---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Danny Silva | Personal Notebook" activeNav="about">
    <main>
        <section class="about-hero">
            <div class="about-image">
                <img src="/assets/danny.png" alt="Author portrait">
            </div>
            <div class="about-intro">
                <h1>Writing about the things that <span>matter most</span></h1>
                <div class="about-text">
                    <p>Hey, I'm Danny. This is my personal notebook—an esoteric journal where I document what I am learning in life, my daily curiosities, what works, and what doesn't.</p>
                    <p>I am an autodidact who believes life is an everlasting learning journey. Right now, much of my focus is on the deficit of attention and how we navigate it. While I occasionally write about tech, this space is decidedly broader. It is a place to slow down, notice patterns, and think in public.</p>
                    <p>This notebook exists primarily as a personal record for posterity, but I share it openly for anyone who might find value in the reflections along the way.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="philosophy">
            <h3 class="philosophy-title">What I Believe</h3>
            <div class="philosophy-grid">
                <div class="philosophy-card">
                    <div class="philosophy-icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                            <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Intentional Slowth</h3>
                    <p>Not all productivity is created equal. I believe in doing fewer things, but doing them with more presence, depth, and satisfaction.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="philosophy-card">
                    <div class="philosophy-icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                            <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/>
                            <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/>
                            <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Design for Living</h3>
                    <p>The spaces we inhabit shape our minds. I write about how thoughtful design — in our homes, our tools, our routines — can create room for clarity.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="philosophy-card">
                    <div class="philosophy-icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                            <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/>
                            <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Words Matter</h3>
                    <p>We're drowning in content but starving for meaning. Each essay here is written to be savored, not skimmed — a small act of resistance against the attention economy.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="philosophy">
            <div class="contact">
                <h2 class="contact-title">Let's Connect</h2>
                <p class="contact-text">Interested in collaborating or just want to say hello? I'd love to hear from you.</p>
                <a href="mailto:danielsp-recruiter-inquiries@outlook.com" class="contact-email">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/>
                        <path d="M22 7l-10 6L2 7"/>
                    </svg>
                    danielsp-recruiter-inquiries@outlook.com
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>
